TUTORIALS.append({'title': 'BAL-1. Setup: what to replace', 'category': 'programming', 'order': 1, 'summary': 'Do this first: which files change and which stay.', 'content': '<p>Step 1 of 7. The app <code>balans</code> already runs on the server, so this is a <strong>replacement</strong>: overwrite the files below one by one. Nothing else changes — <code>queries.py</code> (your SQL) stays as it is, the addresses and the saved parquet files too. No migrations.</p>\n<p>The templates go to <code>balans/templates/balans/</code>, the same place as <code>home.html</code> and <code>result.html</code> now. <code>functions.py</code> no longer has <code>categorize_account</code>; <code>views.py</code> uses <code>build_report</code> instead.</p>\n<p>Files already saved keep working: <code>balans_get</code> added the profit of the year to 31206 before, and still does. One fix there: the profit is now added to <strong>one</strong> 31206 row — before, a 31206 row in two currencies got the profit twice.</p>\n<p>To change a rule later, open <code>functions.py</code>: the top half is plain lists (<code>EXCLUDE</code>, <code>PAIRS</code>, <code>ASSET_GROUPS</code> …). The page reloads them, no other file needs to know.</p>\n<h3>Layout</h3>\n<pre><code class="language-plaintext">balans/\n    functions.py\n    views.py\n    urls.py\n    forms.py\n    queries.py      (yours, unchanged)\n    templates/balans/home.html\n    templates/balans/result.html\n</code></pre>\n'})

TUTORIALS.append({'title': 'BAL-2. functions.py', 'category': 'programming', 'order': 2, 'summary': 'ALL the maths and every rule you may want to change: what is excluded (161, 175 / 222, 23416), which accounts form each group, the official contra-account list, the ratios.', 'content': '<p>Step 2 of 7. Save as <code>balans/functions.py</code> (replace the old one).</p>\n<h3>functions.py</h3>\n<pre><code class="language-python"># -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\n"""\nАналитический баланс: every number on the result page is calculated here.\n\nThe file has two halves:\n  1. RULES  - plain lists you can edit (what to exclude, which accounts form a group).\n  2. MATHS  - build_report(df) turns the balance file into the numbers for the page.\n\nHow an account is matched to a group\n------------------------------------\nBy the beginning of its 5-digit number. The LONGEST matching beginning wins,\nso ("177", ...) and ("17701", ...) can live side by side: 17701 goes to the\nsecond one, 17705 to the first. The order of the lists does not matter.\nAn account that matches nothing goes to the section\'s "Прочие ..." group.\n\nSign in the database\n--------------------\nAssets (class 1) and expenses (class 5) come out NEGATIVE, liabilities,\nequity and income POSITIVE. SIGN below turns them all into normal positive\nmoney. A reserve (12599, 16399 ...) then comes out negative by itself and is\nsubtracted from its group without any special code.\nIf the bank ever changes this, change SIGN - nothing else.\n"""\nimport datetime\n\nimport pandas as pd\n\n# =====================================================================\n# 1. RULES\n# =====================================================================\n\nSIGN = {\'1\': -1, \'2\': 1, \'3\': 1, \'4\': 1, \'5\': -1}\n\n# Accounts left out of the totals (by the beginning of the account number).\nEXCLUDE = {\n    \'1\': [\'161\',     # Bosh ofis/filiallardan olinadigan mablag\'lar - due FROM head office / branches\n          \'175\'],    # Hukumat hisobvaraqlari - government accounts (pair of 23416)\n    \'2\': [\'222\',     # Bosh ofis/filiallarga to\'lanadigan mablag\'lar - due TO head office / branches\n          \'23416\'],  # Maxsus maqsadlar fondi - special purpose fund (pair of 175)\n}\n\n# Pairs that should cancel each other out. The page shows both sides and the difference.\nPAIRS = [\n    (\'161\', \'222\', \'Межфилиальные расчёты (161 ↔ 222)\'),\n    (\'175\', \'23416\', \'Счета правительства (175 ↔ 23416)\'),\n]\n\n# (name, Font Awesome icon, account beginnings)\nASSET_GROUPS = [\n    (\'Касса\', \'fa-money-bill-wave\', [\'101\']),\n    (\'Средства в ЦБ\', \'fa-building-columns\', [\'103\']),\n    (\'Средства в других банках\', \'fa-landmark\', [\'105\']),\n    (\'Ценные бумаги и РЕПО\', \'fa-file-contract\', [\'107\', \'108\', \'118\', \'159\']),\n    (\'Инвестиции в дочерние и ассоциированные\', \'fa-sitemap\', [\'158\']),\n    (\'Кредитный портфель\', \'fa-hand-holding-dollar\',\n     [\'111\', \'119\', \'12\', \'13\', \'14\', \'150\', \'151\', \'152\', \'153\', \'154\', \'155\', \'156\', \'157\', \'17701\']),\n    (\'Начисленные проценты и доходы\', \'fa-percent\', [\'163\', \'164\', \'17703\']),\n    (\'Основные средства и НМА\', \'fa-building\', [\'165\', \'166\']),\n    (\'Имущество банка (в т.ч. по залогу)\', \'fa-house-circle-check\', [\'167\']),\n]\nOTHER_ASSETS = (\'Прочие активы\', \'fa-boxes-stacked\')\n\nLIABILITY_GROUPS = [\n    (\'Депозиты до востребования\', \'fa-wallet\', [\'202\']),\n    (\'Сберегательные депозиты\', \'fa-piggy-bank\', [\'204\']),\n    (\'Срочные депозиты\', \'fa-clock\', [\'206\']),\n    (\'Прочие депозиты клиентов\', \'fa-credit-card\', [\'226\']),\n    (\'Средства ЦБ\', \'fa-building-columns\', [\'208\']),\n    (\'Средства других банков\', \'fa-landmark\', [\'210\']),\n    (\'Полученные кредиты\', \'fa-file-invoice-dollar\', [\'216\', \'220\']),\n    (\'Выпущенные ценные бумаги\', \'fa-file-signature\', [\'236\']),\n    (\'Субординированный долг\', \'fa-layer-group\', [\'237\']),\n    (\'Начисленные проценты к уплате\', \'fa-percent\', [\'224\']),\n]\nOTHER_LIABILITIES = (\'Прочие обязательства\', \'fa-list\')\n\nEQUITY_GROUPS = [\n    (\'Уставный капитал\', \'fa-certificate\', [\'303\']),\n    (\'Добавленный капитал\', \'fa-plus\', [\'306\']),\n    (\'Резервный капитал\', \'fa-shield-halved\', [\'309\']),\n    (\'Нераспределённая прибыль прошлых лет\', \'fa-box-archive\', [\'31203\']),\n    (\'Прибыль текущего года\', \'fa-chart-line\', [\'31206\']),\n]\nOTHER_EQUITY = (\'Прочий капитал\', \'fa-layer-group\')\n\n# P&amp;L: (name, icon, account beginnings, kind). The kind decides where the line goes in\n# "Как складывается прибыль": int = interest, nonint = other income/expense,\n# opex = operating expenses, reserve = provisions, tax = profit tax.\nINCOME_GROUPS = [\n    (\'Процентные доходы\', \'fa-arrow-trend-up\', [\'40\', \'41\', \'42\', \'43\', \'44\', \'450\', \'451\'], \'int\'),\n    (\'Комиссии и прочие беспроцентные доходы\', \'fa-coins\', [\'452\', \'459\'], \'nonint\'),\n    (\'Доходы от валютных операций\', \'fa-dollar-sign\', [\'454\'], \'nonint\'),\n    (\'Торговые операции и инвестиции\', \'fa-chart-pie\', [\'456\', \'457\', \'458\'], \'nonint\'),\n]\nOTHER_INCOME = (\'Прочие доходы\', \'fa-circle-plus\', \'nonint\')\n\nEXPENSE_GROUPS = [\n    (\'Процентные расходы\', \'fa-arrow-trend-down\', [\'50\', \'51\', \'52\', \'53\', \'54\'], \'int\'),\n    (\'Комиссии и прочие беспроцентные расходы\', \'fa-receipt\', [\'551\', \'559\'], \'nonint\'),\n    (\'Убытки по валютным операциям\', \'fa-dollar-sign\', [\'553\'], \'nonint\'),\n    (\'Убытки по торговым операциям и инвестициям\', \'fa-chart-pie\', [\'556\', \'557\', \'558\'], \'nonint\'),\n    (\'Персонал\', \'fa-users\', [\'561\'], \'opex\'),\n    (\'Аренда и содержание\', \'fa-house\', [\'562\'], \'opex\'),\n    (\'Командировки и транспорт\', \'fa-car\', [\'563\'], \'opex\'),\n    (\'Административные расходы\', \'fa-briefcase\', [\'564\'], \'opex\'),\n    (\'Представительские и благотворительность\', \'fa-handshake\', [\'565\'], \'opex\'),\n    (\'Амортизация\', \'fa-building\', [\'566\'], \'opex\'),\n    (\'Страхование и налоги (кроме налога на прибыль)\', \'fa-file-shield\', [\'567\'], \'opex\'),\n    (\'Резервы на возможные убытки\', \'fa-shield-halved\', [\'568\', \'577\'], \'reserve\'),\n    (\'Налог на прибыль\', \'fa-landmark-dome\', [\'569\'], \'tax\'),\n]\nOTHER_EXPENSES = (\'Прочие расходы\', \'fa-circle-minus\', \'nonint\')\n\n# Groups used by the ratios (names must match the lists above).\nLOANS = \'Кредитный портфель\'\nDEPOSITS = [\'Депозиты до востребования\', \'Сберегательные депозиты\', \'Срочные депозиты\', \'Прочие депозиты клиентов\']\nLIQUID = [\'Касса\', \'Средства в ЦБ\', \'Средства в других банках\']\n\n# Contra accounts: reserves, depreciation, discounts, own shares. These REDUCE their group.\n# This is the official list - every account the CBU chart of accounts (reg. 3336) marks\n# "kontr-aktiv" / "kontr-passiv" in classes 1-3. Used only to show "брутто / резервы" per\n# group: the totals are right without it, because the sign already subtracts them.\nCONTRA = {\n    \'10599\', \'10791\', \'10799\', \'10891\', \'10899\', \'10999\', \'11195\', \'11199\', \'11599\', \'11899\',\n    \'12199\', \'12399\', \'12599\', \'12699\', \'12799\', \'12899\', \'12999\', \'13099\', \'13199\', \'13299\',\n    \'13399\', \'14399\', \'14499\', \'14599\', \'14799\', \'14999\', \'15099\', \'15199\', \'15299\', \'15399\',\n    \'15499\', \'15599\', \'15799\', \'15899\', \'15991\', \'15999\', \'16398\', \'16399\', \'16498\', \'16499\',\n    \'16511\', \'16519\', \'16531\', \'16539\', \'16543\', \'16551\', \'16563\', \'16593\', \'16605\', \'16699\',\n    \'16713\', \'16799\', \'16899\', \'17700\', \'17701\', \'17703\', \'17705\', \'19911\', \'19933\', \'19945\',\n    \'19999\',\n    \'23698\', \'23798\',                        # discount on issued securities / subordinated debt\n    \'30303\', \'30306\', \'30321\', \'30324\',      # unpaid subscription, own shares bought back\n}\n\nCURRENCIES = {\'000\': \'UZS\', \'840\': \'USD\', \'978\': \'EUR\', \'643\': \'RUB\', \'156\': \'CNY\',\n              \'826\': \'GBP\', \'392\': \'JPY\', \'756\': \'CHF\', \'398\': \'KZT\'}\n# one fixed colour per currency, so UZS / USD look the same on the assets and the liabilities bar\nCURRENCY_COLOURS = {\'UZS\': \'#F2C230\', \'USD\': \'#2A2A2E\', \'EUR\': \'#C9971A\', \'RUB\': \'#8A867C\', \'CNY\': \'#F7DC85\'}\n\n# Colours for the stacked bars (Kapitalbank palette: yellow first, then charcoal, gold, greys).\nPALETTE = [\'#F2C230\', \'#2A2A2E\', \'#C9971A\', \'#8A867C\', \'#F7DC85\', \'#55524B\',\n           \'#E8B923\', \'#B9B5AB\', \'#6E5410\', \'#D9D5CB\', \'#3F3D38\', \'#FFF0B8\']\n\n# =====================================================================\n# 2. MATHS\n# =====================================================================\n\n\ndef match(acc, groups, other):\n    """The group whose account beginning is the longest match; `other` if none."""\n    best, best_len = other, 0\n    for g in groups:\n        for p in g[2]:\n            if acc.startswith(p) and len(p) &gt; best_len:\n                best, best_len = g, len(p)\n    return best\n\n\ndef starts(series, prefixes):\n    return series.str.startswith(tuple(prefixes)) if prefixes else series.str.startswith(\'\\0\')\n\n\ndef pct(part, whole):\n    return part / whole * 100 if whole else 0.0\n\n\ndef width(p):\n    """Bar width for CSS - always a dot, never a locale comma ("12.5" not "12,5")."""\n    return f\'{max(0.0, min(100.0, p)):.2f}\'\n\n\ndef section_rows(d, groups, other, total):\n    """One row per group of a section: gross, reserves, net, share of the total."""\n    rows = []\n    for (name, icon), part in d.groupby([\'grp\', \'icon\'], sort=False):\n        net = part[\'money\'].sum()\n        contra = part.loc[part[\'contra\'], \'money\'].sum()\n        rows.append({\'name\': name, \'icon\': icon, \'net\': net,\n                     \'gross\': net - contra, \'reserve\': -contra, \'has_reserve\': abs(contra) &gt; 0.5,\n                     \'pct\': pct(net, total), \'w\': width(pct(abs(net), total))})\n    rows = [r for r in rows if abs(r[\'net\']) &gt; 0.5 or r[\'has_reserve\']]\n    rows.sort(key=lambda r: r[\'net\'], reverse=True)\n    for i, r in enumerate(rows):\n        r[\'colour\'] = PALETTE[i % len(PALETTE)]\n    return rows\n\n\ndef label_groups(d, groups, other):\n    picked = d[\'acc\'].map(lambda a: match(a, groups, other))\n    d = d.copy()\n    d[\'grp\'] = picked.map(lambda g: g[0])\n    d[\'icon\'] = picked.map(lambda g: g[1])\n    if len(other) == 3:                               # P&amp;L groups also carry a kind\n        d[\'kind\'] = picked.map(lambda g: g[-1])\n    return d\n\n\ndef top_accounts(d, total, n=10):\n    by = d.groupby(\'acc\', as_index=False).agg(money=(\'money\', \'sum\'), grp=(\'grp\', \'first\'))\n    by = by.reindex(by[\'money\'].abs().sort_values(ascending=False).index).head(n)\n    return [{\'acc\': r.acc, \'grp\': r.grp, \'money\': r.money, \'pct\': pct(r.money, total)}\n            for r in by.itertuples()]\n\n\ndef currency_split(d, total):\n    by = d.groupby(\'cur\')[\'money\'].sum().sort_values(ascending=False)\n    out = []\n    for i, (cur, money) in enumerate(by.items()):\n        if abs(money) &gt; 0.5:\n            out.append({\'cur\': cur, \'money\': money, \'pct\': pct(money, total),\n                        \'w\': width(pct(money, total)),\n                        \'colour\': CURRENCY_COLOURS.get(cur, PALETTE[(i + 5) % len(PALETTE)])})\n    return out\n\n\ndef waterfall(steps):\n    """steps: [(label, delta, is_subtotal)] -&gt; rows with bar offsets for a CSS waterfall."""\n    run, points = 0.0, []\n    for label, delta, is_sub in steps:\n        start = 0.0 if is_sub else run\n        end = delta if is_sub else run + delta\n        if not is_sub:\n            run = end\n        points.append((label, delta, is_sub, start, end))\n    lo = min([0.0] + [min(s, e) for *_, s, e in points])\n    hi = max([0.0] + [max(s, e) for *_, s, e in points])\n    span = (hi - lo) or 1.0\n    rows = []\n    for label, delta, is_sub, start, end in points:\n        left = (min(start, end) - lo) / span * 100\n        rows.append({\'label\': label, \'value\': end if is_sub else delta, \'is_sub\': is_sub,\n                     \'neg\': (end if is_sub else delta) &lt; 0,\n                     \'left\': width(left), \'w\': width(max(abs(end - start) / span * 100, 0.4))})\n    return rows\n\n\ndef build_report(df, date_str):\n    """df: arcdate, account, currency, amount (as saved by balans_get). Returns the page context."""\n    d = df.copy()\n    d[\'acc\'] = d[\'account\'].astype(str).str.strip().str.replace(r\'\\.0$\', \'\', regex=True).str[:5]\n    d[\'cls\'] = d[\'acc\'].str[0]\n    d[\'money\'] = d[\'amount\'].astype(float) * d[\'cls\'].map(SIGN).fillna(0)\n    d[\'contra\'] = d[\'acc\'].isin(CONTRA)\n    cur = d[\'currency\'].astype(str).str.strip().str.replace(r\'\\.0$\', \'\', regex=True).str.zfill(3)\n    d[\'cur\'] = cur.map(CURRENCIES).fillna(cur)\n\n    excluded = pd.Series(False, index=d.index)\n    for cls, prefixes in EXCLUDE.items():\n        excluded |= (d[\'cls\'] == cls) &amp; starts(d[\'acc\'], prefixes)\n\n    A = label_groups(d[(d[\'cls\'] == \'1\') &amp; ~excluded], ASSET_GROUPS, OTHER_ASSETS)\n    L = label_groups(d[(d[\'cls\'] == \'2\') &amp; ~excluded], LIABILITY_GROUPS, OTHER_LIABILITIES)\n    E = label_groups(d[d[\'cls\'] == \'3\'], EQUITY_GROUPS, OTHER_EQUITY)\n    I = label_groups(d[d[\'cls\'] == \'4\'], INCOME_GROUPS, OTHER_INCOME)\n    X = label_groups(d[d[\'cls\'] == \'5\'], EXPENSE_GROUPS, OTHER_EXPENSES)\n\n    assets, liabs, equity = A[\'money\'].sum(), L[\'money\'].sum(), E[\'money\'].sum()\n    income, expenses = I[\'money\'].sum(), X[\'money\'].sum()\n    profit = income - expenses\n    passive = liabs + equity\n\n    asset_rows = section_rows(A, ASSET_GROUPS, OTHER_ASSETS, assets)\n    liab_rows = section_rows(L, LIABILITY_GROUPS, OTHER_LIABILITIES, passive)\n    equity_rows = section_rows(E, EQUITY_GROUPS, OTHER_EQUITY, passive)\n    income_rows = section_rows(I, INCOME_GROUPS, OTHER_INCOME, income)\n    expense_rows = section_rows(X, EXPENSE_GROUPS, OTHER_EXPENSES, expenses)\n\n    # passive side bar = liabilities in their colours, then equity as one charcoal-free block\n    passive_bar = [dict(r) for r in liab_rows] + [{\'name\': \'Капитал\', \'net\': equity, \'colour\': \'#0B0B0C\',\n                                                   \'pct\': pct(equity, passive), \'w\': width(pct(equity, passive))}]\n    for r in passive_bar:\n        r[\'w\'] = width(pct(r[\'net\'], passive))\n\n    # --- the checks -----------------------------------------------------------------\n    def money_of(prefix):\n        return d.loc[d[\'acc\'].str.startswith(prefix), \'money\'].sum()\n\n    gap = assets - passive\n    tolerance = max(1.0, abs(assets) * 1e-6)\n    pairs = [{\'label\': label, \'a_val\': money_of(a), \'l_val\': money_of(l), \'diff\': money_of(a) - money_of(l)}\n             for a, l, label in PAIRS]\n    for p in pairs:\n        p[\'ok\'] = abs(p[\'diff\']) &lt;= tolerance\n    balance_ok = abs(gap) &lt;= tolerance\n    gap_is_profit = not balance_ok and abs(gap + profit) &lt;= max(tolerance, abs(profit) * 1e-6)\n    # leaving a pair out moves the balance by -(asset side - liability side)\n    pairs_gap = -sum(p[\'diff\'] for p in pairs)\n    gap_is_pairs = not balance_ok and abs(gap - pairs_gap) &lt;= tolerance\n\n    # --- P&amp;L by kind and the waterfall --------------------------------------------\n    def kind_sum(frame, kind):\n        return frame.loc[frame[\'kind\'] == kind, \'money\'].sum()\n\n    int_inc, int_exp = kind_sum(I, \'int\'), kind_sum(X, \'int\')\n    non_inc, non_exp = kind_sum(I, \'nonint\'), kind_sum(X, \'nonint\')\n    opex, reserves_exp, tax = kind_sum(X, \'opex\'), kind_sum(X, \'reserve\'), kind_sum(X, \'tax\')\n    nii = int_inc - int_exp\n    op_income = nii + non_inc - non_exp\n    pre_provision = op_income - opex\n    pre_tax = pre_provision - reserves_exp\n    steps = waterfall([\n        (\'Процентные доходы\', int_inc, False),\n        (\'Процентные расходы\', -int_exp, False),\n        (\'Чистый процентный доход\', nii, True),\n        (\'Беспроцентные доходы\', non_inc, False),\n        (\'Беспроцентные расходы\', -non_exp, False),\n        (\'Операционный доход\', op_income, True),\n        (\'Операционные расходы\', -opex, False),\n        (\'Прибыль до резервов\', pre_provision, True),\n        (\'Резервы на возможные убытки\', -reserves_exp, False),\n        (\'Прибыль до налога\', pre_tax, True),\n        (\'Налог на прибыль\', -tax, False),\n        (\'Чистая прибыль\', pre_tax - tax, True),\n    ])\n\n    # --- ratios ---------------------------------------------------------------------\n    loan = next((r for r in asset_rows if r[\'name\'] == LOANS), None)\n    gross_loans = loan[\'gross\'] if loan else 0.0\n    loan_reserves = loan[\'reserve\'] if loan else 0.0\n    deposits = sum(r[\'net\'] for r in liab_rows if r[\'name\'] in DEPOSITS)\n    liquid = sum(r[\'net\'] for r in asset_rows if r[\'name\'] in LIQUID)\n    try:\n        day = datetime.date.fromisoformat(str(date_str)[:10])\n        year_factor = 365 / day.timetuple().tm_yday       # P&amp;L accounts run from 1 January\n    except ValueError:\n        year_factor = 1.0\n    ratios = [\n        {\'name\': \'Кредиты / Депозиты (LDR)\', \'value\': pct(gross_loans, deposits), \'icon\': \'fa-scale-balanced\',\n         \'how\': \'Кредитный портфель брутто / депозиты клиентов (202, 204, 206, 226)\'},\n        {\'name\': \'Капитал / Активы\', \'value\': pct(equity, assets), \'icon\': \'fa-shield\',\n         \'how\': \'Бухгалтерский капитал / активы. Это НЕ норматив адекватности капитала ЦБ (3697)\'},\n        {\'name\': \'Ликвидные активы / Активы\', \'value\': pct(liquid, assets), \'icon\': \'fa-droplet\',\n         \'how\': \'Касса + ЦБ + другие банки (нетто) / активы\'},\n        {\'name\': \'Cost / Income (CIR)\', \'value\': pct(opex, op_income), \'icon\': \'fa-gauge\',\n         \'how\': \'Операционные расходы (561–567) / операционный доход (без резервов и налога)\'},\n        {\'name\': \'Резервы / Кредиты\', \'value\': pct(loan_reserves, gross_loans), \'icon\': \'fa-umbrella\',\n         \'how\': \'Резервы по кредитам (…99, 17701) / кредитный портфель брутто\'},\n        {\'name\': \'ROA (годовых)\', \'value\': pct(profit * year_factor, assets), \'icon\': \'fa-percent\',\n         \'how\': \'Прибыль с начала года, приведённая к году / активы\'},\n        {\'name\': \'ROE (годовых)\', \'value\': pct(profit * year_factor, equity), \'icon\': \'fa-chart-line\',\n         \'how\': \'Прибыль с начала года, приведённая к году / капитал\'},\n    ]\n\n    rules = {\n        \'assets\': \', \'.join(EXCLUDE.get(\'1\', [])) or \'—\',\n        \'liabilities\': \', \'.join(EXCLUDE.get(\'2\', [])) or \'—\',\n    }\n\n    return {\n        \'date_str\': date_str,\n        \'date_display\': \'.\'.join(reversed(str(date_str)[:10].split(\'-\'))),\n        \'total_assets\': assets, \'total_liabilities\': liabs, \'total_equity\': equity, \'total_passive\': passive,\n        \'total_income\': income, \'total_expenses\': expenses, \'net_profit\': profit,\n        \'assets_structure\': asset_rows, \'liabilities_structure\': liab_rows, \'equity_structure\': equity_rows,\n        \'income_structure\': income_rows, \'expense_structure\': expense_rows,\n        \'passive_bar\': passive_bar,\n        \'liab_w\': width(pct(liabs, passive)), \'equity_w\': width(pct(equity, passive)),\n        \'equity_pct\': pct(equity, passive),\n        \'balance_gap\': gap, \'balance_ok\': balance_ok, \'gap_is_profit\': gap_is_profit,\n        \'pairs\': pairs, \'gap_is_pairs\': gap_is_pairs,\n        \'waterfall\': steps, \'ratios\': ratios, \'rules\': rules,\n        \'top_assets\': top_accounts(A, assets), \'top_liabilities\': top_accounts(L, passive),\n        \'assets_by_currency\': currency_split(A, assets), \'liabs_by_currency\': currency_split(L, liabs),\n    }\n</code></pre>\n'})

TUTORIALS.append({'title': 'BAL-3. views.py', 'category': 'programming', 'order': 3, 'summary': 'The three pages: choose a date, load it from Oracle, show the report.', 'content': '<p>Step 3 of 7. Save as <code>balans/views.py</code> (replace the old one).</p>\n<h3>views.py</h3>\n<pre><code class="language-python"># -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\n"""\nThree pages:\n  balans_home   - choose a date. If that date is already saved, go straight to the result.\n  balans_get    - load the balance for the date from Oracle and save it as a parquet file.\n  balans_result - read the parquet file and show the report (all maths: functions.build_report).\n"""\nimport datetime\nimport os\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nimport pandas as pd\nfrom django.contrib import messages\nfrom django.contrib.auth.decorators import login_required\nfrom django.shortcuts import redirect, render\n\nfrom functions import common_functions\n\nfrom . import forms, queries\nfrom .functions import build_report\n\nBASE_DIR = Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent\nbalans_svod_folder = BASE_DIR / "datasets" / "balans" / "svod"\n\n\ndef file_for(date_str):\n    return balans_svod_folder / f"balans_{date_str}.parquet"\n\n\n@login_required\ndef balans_home(request):\n    form = forms.DateInputForm(request.POST or None)\n    if request.method == \'POST\' and form.is_valid():\n        date_str = str(form.cleaned_data[\'selected_date\'])\n        request.session[f"balans_date_str_{request.user.id}"] = date_str\n        request.session[f"balans_filepath_svod_{request.user.id}"] = str(file_for(date_str))\n        if file_for(date_str).exists():\n            messages.success(request, "Данные за эту дату уже загружены.")\n            return redirect(\'balans-result\')\n        return redirect(\'balans-get\')\n    return render(request, \'balans/home.html\', {\'form\': form})\n\n\n@login_required\ndef balans_get(request):\n    date_str = request.session.get(f"balans_date_str_{request.user.id}")\n    try:\n        selected_date = datetime.date.fromisoformat(date_str)\n    except (TypeError, ValueError):\n        messages.warning(request, "Сначала выберите дату.")\n        return redirect(\'balans-home\')\n\n    os.makedirs(balans_svod_folder, exist_ok=True)\n    conn = None\n    try:\n        conn = common_functions.get_oracle_connection()\n        cursor = conn.cursor()\n        cursor.execute(queries.balans_script, {\'pdate\': selected_date})\n        rows = cursor.fetchall()\n        if not rows:\n            messages.warning(request, \'Данных за эту дату ещё нет.\')\n            return redirect(\'balans-home\')\n        df = pd.DataFrame(rows, columns=[\'arcdate\', \'account\', \'currency\', \'amount\'])\n\n        # Profit of the current year is still sitting in classes 4 and 5 (they close only at\n        # year end), so it is added to 31206 «Sof foyda (zarar)» - otherwise the balance does\n        # not add up. Added ONCE: 31206 can have a row per currency, and adding it to each\n        # row would count the profit twice.\n        acc = df[\'account\'].astype(str)\n        profit = abs(df.loc[acc.str.startswith(\'4\'), \'amount\'].sum()) - abs(df.loc[acc.str.startswith(\'5\'), \'amount\'].sum())\n        is_31206 = acc.str[:5] == \'31206\'\n        if is_31206.any():\n            df.loc[is_31206.idxmax(), \'amount\'] += profit\n        else:\n            print(\'WARNING: no 31206 row - the profit of the year is not in the equity\')\n\n        tmp = file_for(date_str).with_suffix(\'.tmp\')\n        df.to_parquet(tmp, index=False)\n        tmp.replace(file_for(date_str))          # never leaves a half-written file behind\n    except Exception as e:\n        import traceback\n        traceback.print_exc()\n        messages.error(request, f"Ошибка при загрузке из базы: {e}")\n        return redirect(\'balans-home\')\n    finally:\n        if conn:\n            conn.close()\n\n    messages.success(request, f"Баланс за {selected_date:%d.%m.%Y} загружен.")\n    return redirect(\'balans-result\')\n\n\n@login_required\ndef balans_result(request):\n    date_str = request.session.get(f"balans_date_str_{request.user.id}")\n    if not date_str or not file_for(date_str).exists():\n        date_str = str(common_functions.find_recent_date(file_name=\'balans\'))\n    if not file_for(date_str).exists():\n        messages.warning(request, "Нет данных. Сначала выберите дату.")\n        return redirect(\'balans-home\')\n\n    df = pd.read_parquet(file_for(date_str))\n    df.columns = [\'arcdate\', \'account\', \'currency\', \'amount\']\n    return render(request, \'balans/result.html\', build_report(df, date_str))\n</code></pre>\n'})

TUTORIALS.append({'title': 'BAL-4. urls.py', 'category': 'programming', 'order': 4, 'summary': 'The same three addresses as before.', 'content': '<p>Step 4 of 7. Save as <code>balans/urls.py</code> (replace the old one).</p>\n<h3>urls.py</h3>\n<pre><code class="language-python">from django.urls import path\n\nfrom . import views\n\nurlpatterns = [\n    path(\'\', views.balans_home, name=\'balans-home\'),\n    path(\'get\', views.balans_get, name=\'balans-get\'),\n    path(\'result\', views.balans_result, name=\'balans-result\'),\n]\n</code></pre>\n'})

TUTORIALS.append({'title': 'BAL-5. forms.py', 'category': 'programming', 'order': 5, 'summary': 'The date field — now opens on the last working day.', 'content': '<p>Step 5 of 7. Save as <code>balans/forms.py</code> (replace the old one).</p>\n<h3>forms.py</h3>\n<pre><code class="language-python">import datetime\n\nfrom django import forms\n\n\ndef last_working_day():\n    day = datetime.date.today() - datetime.timedelta(days=1)\n    while day.weekday() &gt;= 5:              # Saturday, Sunday -&gt; Friday\n        day -= datetime.timedelta(days=1)\n    return day\n\n\nclass DateInputForm(forms.Form):\n    selected_date = forms.DateField(\n        label=\'Дата баланса\',\n        initial=last_working_day,\n        widget=forms.DateInput(attrs={\'type\': \'date\', \'class\': \'form-control form-control-lg\'}, format=\'%Y-%m-%d\'),\n    )\n</code></pre>\n'})

TUTORIALS.append({'title': 'BAL-6. templates/balans/home.html', 'category': 'programming', 'order': 6, 'summary': 'Choose a date.', 'content': '<p>Step 6 of 7. Save as <code>balans/templates/balans/home.html</code> (replace the old one).</p>\n<h3>templates/balans/home.html</h3>\n<pre><code class="language-html">{% extends \'base.html\' %}\n{% block content %}\n{% if user.is_authenticated %}\n&lt;style&gt;\n  .bal{--ink:#0B0B0C;--gold:#F2C230;--gd:#C9971A;--gtext:#8C6A12;--rule:#E4E1D8;--paper:#FAF8F2;--muted:#8A867C;color:var(--ink)}\n  .bal .hero{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:26px 28px;margin-bottom:20px}\n  .bal .eyebrow{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold)}\n  .bal .hero h1{font-weight:500;font-size:26px;margin:6px 0 8px}\n  .bal .hero h1 i{color:var(--gold);margin-right:10px}\n  .bal .hero p{color:#B9B5AB;margin:0}\n  .bal .box{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:12px;padding:22px}\n  .bal .btn-go{background:var(--gold);border:none;color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}\n  .bal .btn-go:hover{background:var(--gd);color:var(--ink)}\n  .bal .what{margin:0;padding-left:18px;color:#55524B;line-height:1.7}\n&lt;/style&gt;\n&lt;div class="container py-4 bal" style="max-width:760px"&gt;\n  &lt;div class="hero"&gt;\n    &lt;div class="eyebrow"&gt;Аналитический баланс&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;h1&gt;&lt;i class="fa-solid fa-building-columns"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;Баланс банка на дату&lt;/h1&gt;\n    &lt;p&gt;Активы, обязательства, капитал, прибыль с начала года и основные показатели — на одной странице.&lt;/p&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;div class="box mb-3"&gt;\n    &lt;form method="post"&gt;\n      {% csrf_token %}\n      &lt;label class="form-label fw-semibold" for="{{ form.selected_date.id_for_label }}"&gt;{{ form.selected_date.label }}&lt;/label&gt;\n      &lt;div class="d-flex gap-2 flex-wrap"&gt;\n        &lt;div style="flex:1;min-width:200px"&gt;{{ form.selected_date }}&lt;/div&gt;\n        &lt;button type="submit" class="btn btn-go btn-lg px-4"&gt;Показать &lt;i class="fas fa-arrow-right ms-1"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/button&gt;\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n      {% if form.selected_date.errors %}&lt;div class="text-danger small mt-2"&gt;{{ form.selected_date.errors|join:" " }}&lt;/div&gt;{% endif %}\n    &lt;/form&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;div class="box"&gt;\n    &lt;ul class="what"&gt;\n      &lt;li&gt;Если дата уже загружалась, отчёт откроется сразу; если нет — данные загрузятся из базы (это займёт немного времени).&lt;/li&gt;\n      &lt;li&gt;Межфилиальные расчёты (161 / 222) и счета правительства (175 / 23416) исключены с обеих сторон.&lt;/li&gt;\n      &lt;li&gt;На странице отчёта есть проверка: сходится ли баланс.&lt;/li&gt;\n    &lt;/ul&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n{% else %}\n&lt;div class="container py-5 text-center"&gt;\n  &lt;i class="fas fa-lock fa-3x mb-3"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;\n  &lt;h3&gt;Доступ ограничен&lt;/h3&gt;\n  &lt;a href="{% url \'login\' %}" class="btn btn-warning mt-2"&gt;&lt;i class="fas fa-sign-in-alt me-1"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;Войти&lt;/a&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n{% endif %}\n{% endblock content %}\n</code></pre>\n'})

TUTORIALS.append({'title': 'BAL-7. templates/balans/result.html', 'category': 'programming', 'order': 7, 'summary': 'The report: the balance check, structure bars, assets / liabilities / equity, ratios, how the profit is made, currencies, largest accounts, how it is calculated.', 'content': '<p>Step 7 of 7. Save as <code>balans/templates/balans/result.html</code> (replace the old one).</p>\n<h3>templates/balans/result.html</h3>\n<pre><code class="language-html">{% extends \'base.html\' %}\n{% load currency_filters %}\n{% block content %}\n{% if user.is_authenticated %}\n&lt;script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/html2canvas/1.4.1/html2canvas.min.js"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;\n&lt;style&gt;\n  .bal{--ink:#0B0B0C;--soft:#2A2A2E;--gold:#F2C230;--gd:#C9971A;--gtext:#8C6A12;\n       --rule:#E4E1D8;--paper:#FAF8F2;--muted:#8A867C;--bad:#B3341F;color:var(--ink)}\n  .bal .toolbar{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:16px}\n  .bal .btn-go{background:var(--gold);border:none;color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}\n  .bal .btn-go:hover{background:var(--gd);color:var(--ink)}\n  .bal .btn-line{border:1px solid var(--rule);background:#fff;color:var(--ink)}\n  .bal .btn-line:hover{border-color:var(--gold)}\n  #export-area{background:#fff;padding:24px;border-radius:14px}\n  .bal .hero{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:22px 26px;margin-bottom:20px}\n  .bal .eyebrow{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold)}\n  .bal .hero h1{font-weight:500;font-size:26px;margin:6px 0 18px}\n  .bal .hero h1 i{color:var(--gold);margin-right:10px}\n  .bal .tiles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(170px,1fr));gap:12px}\n  .bal .tile{border:1px solid #3F3D38;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px}\n  .bal .tile .l{font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#B9B5AB}\n  .bal .tile .v{font-size:20px;font-weight:600;margin-top:4px;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n  .bal .tile .n{font-size:12px;color:#B9B5AB}\n  .bal .tile.gold{border-color:var(--gold)}\n  .bal .tile.gold .v{color:var(--gold)}\n  .bal .box{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:20px}\n  .bal .box-head{background:var(--paper);border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;\n       padding:10px 16px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gtext);\n       display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .bal .box-head i{margin-right:8px;color:var(--gd)}\n  .bal .box-head .hint{letter-spacing:0;text-transform:none;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}\n  .bal .box-body{padding:14px 16px}\n  .bal .m{text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n  .bal .muted{color:var(--muted)}\n  .bal .bad{color:var(--bad)}\n  /* the balance check */\n  .bal .check{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;padding:14px 16px}\n  .bal .check .mark{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\n       font-size:20px;flex-shrink:0;background:var(--gold);color:var(--ink)}\n  .bal .check.off .mark{background:var(--bad);color:#fff}\n  .bal table{font-size:13px;margin:0;width:100%}\n  .bal th{font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600;\n       padding:6px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)}\n  .bal td{padding:6px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid #F0EEE7}\n  /* stacked 100% bars */\n  .bal .stack-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:10px}\n  .bal .stack-row .lab{width:90px;font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--muted)}\n  .bal .stack{flex:1;display:flex;height:34px;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:#F0EEE7}\n  .bal .stack span{display:block;height:100%}\n  .bal .legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 16px;font-size:12.5px;margin:4px 0 14px 102px}\n  .bal .legend i{display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:2px;margin-right:6px}\n  /* group lists */\n  .bal .side-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;border-bottom:2px solid var(--ink);\n       padding-bottom:6px;margin-bottom:8px}\n  .bal .side-head .t{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600}\n  .bal .side-head .v{font-size:18px;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n  .bal .grp{padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #F0EEE7}\n  .bal .grp-top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}\n  .bal .grp-icon{width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--paper);display:flex;align-items:center;\n       justify-content:center;color:var(--gd);flex-shrink:0;font-size:14px}\n  .bal .grp-name{flex:1;font-weight:500;font-size:14px;line-height:1.25}\n  .bal .grp-val{text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-weight:600}\n  .bal .grp-val small{display:block;font-weight:400;color:var(--muted)}\n  .bal .bar{height:6px;background:#F0EEE7;border-radius:6px;margin:6px 0 0 42px;overflow:hidden}\n  .bal .bar span{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--gold);border-radius:6px}\n  .bal .bar.dark span{background:var(--soft)}\n  .bal .net-line{margin:6px 0 0 42px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n  /* waterfall */\n  .bal .wf-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(150px,230px) 1fr 150px;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:4px 0}\n  .bal .wf-row.sub{border-top:1px solid var(--rule);font-weight:600}\n  .bal .wf-track{position:relative;height:20px}\n  .bal .wf-track span{position:absolute;top:0;height:100%;border-radius:3px;background:var(--gold)}\n  .bal .wf-row.neg .wf-track span{background:#B9B5AB}\n  .bal .wf-row.sub .wf-track span{background:var(--ink)}\n  .bal .wf-row.sub.neg .wf-track span{background:var(--bad)}\n  /* ratios */\n  .bal .kpis{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));gap:12px}\n  .bal .kpi{border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px}\n  .bal .kpi .l{font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}\n  .bal .kpi .l i{color:var(--gd);margin-right:6px}\n  .bal .kpi .v{font-size:24px;font-weight:600;margin:2px 0}\n  .bal .kpi .h{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.35}\n  .bal .rules{margin:0;padding-left:18px;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.6}\n  @media (max-width:576px){\n    #export-area{padding:10px}\n    .bal .legend{margin-left:0}\n    .bal .stack-row{flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;gap:4px}\n    .bal .stack{flex:none;width:100%}\n    .bal .wf-row{grid-template-columns:1fr 110px}\n    .bal .wf-track{grid-column:1 / -1;grid-row:2}\n  }\n&lt;/style&gt;\n\n&lt;div class="container-fluid py-3 bal" style="max-width:1280px"&gt;\n  &lt;div class="toolbar" data-html2canvas-ignore&gt;\n    &lt;a href="{% url \'balans-home\' %}" class="btn btn-line rounded-pill px-4"&gt;&lt;i class="fas fa-arrow-left me-2"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;Другая дата&lt;/a&gt;\n    &lt;div class="d-flex gap-2 flex-wrap"&gt;\n      &lt;a href="{% url \'risk-result\' %}" class="btn btn-line rounded-pill px-4"&gt;&lt;i class="fa-solid fa-bullhorn me-2"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;Risk Page&lt;/a&gt;\n      &lt;button onclick="downloadDashboard()" class="btn btn-go rounded-pill px-4"&gt;&lt;i class="fas fa-download me-2"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;Экспорт (PNG)&lt;/button&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n\n  &lt;div id="export-area"&gt;\n    &lt;!-- 1. Hero --&gt;\n    &lt;div class="hero"&gt;\n      &lt;div class="eyebrow"&gt;Аналитический баланс&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;h1&gt;&lt;i class="fa-solid fa-building-columns"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;Баланс на {{ date_display }}&lt;/h1&gt;\n      &lt;div class="tiles"&gt;\n        &lt;div class="tile gold"&gt;&lt;div class="l"&gt;Активы&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="v"&gt;{{ total_assets|format_currency }}&lt;/div&gt;\n          &lt;div class="n"&gt;без {{ rules.assets }}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n        &lt;div class="tile"&gt;&lt;div class="l"&gt;Обязательства&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="v"&gt;{{ total_liabilities|format_currency }}&lt;/div&gt;\n          &lt;div class="n"&gt;без {{ rules.liabilities }}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n        &lt;div class="tile"&gt;&lt;div class="l"&gt;Капитал&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="v"&gt;{{ total_equity|format_currency }}&lt;/div&gt;\n          &lt;div class="n"&gt;{{ equity_pct|floatformat:1 }}% пассивов&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n        &lt;div class="tile"&gt;&lt;div class="l"&gt;Чистая прибыль&lt;/div&gt;\n          &lt;div class="v{% if net_profit &lt; 0 %} bad{% endif %}"&gt;{{ net_profit|format_currency }}&lt;/div&gt;\n          &lt;div class="n"&gt;с начала года&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n\n    &lt;!-- 2. Does it add up? --&gt;\n    &lt;div class="box"&gt;\n      &lt;div class="check{% if not balance_ok %} off{% endif %}"&gt;\n        &lt;div class="mark"&gt;&lt;i class="fas {% if balance_ok %}fa-check{% else %}fa-xmark{% endif %}"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n        &lt;div&gt;\n          {% if balance_ok %}\n            &lt;strong&gt;Баланс сходится:&lt;/strong&gt; активы = обязательства + капитал.\n          {% else %}\n            &lt;strong&gt;Баланс не сходится на {{ balance_gap|format_currency }}.&lt;/strong&gt;\n            {% if gap_is_profit %}Разница равна прибыли года — значит, она не добавлена в 31206.\n            {% elif gap_is_pairs %}Вся разница — из исключённых пар ниже: их стороны не равны друг другу.\n            {% else %}Посмотрите пары ниже и счета, не попавшие ни в одну группу («Прочие»).{% endif %}\n          {% endif %}\n          &lt;div class="muted small"&gt;Активы {{ total_assets|format_currency }} · Обязательства + капитал {{ total_passive|format_currency }}&lt;/div&gt;\n        &lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;table&gt;\n        &lt;thead&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;Исключённые пары&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th class="m"&gt;Актив&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th class="m"&gt;Пассив&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th class="m"&gt;Разница&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/thead&gt;\n        &lt;tbody&gt;\n        {% for p in pairs %}\n          &lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;{{ p.label }}&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class="m"&gt;{{ p.a_val|format_currency }}&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class="m"&gt;{{ p.l_val|format_currency }}&lt;/td&gt;\n              &lt;td class="m{% if not p.ok %} bad{% endif %}"&gt;{{ p.diff|format_currency }}&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;\n        {% endfor %}\n        &lt;/tbody&gt;\n      &lt;/table&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n\n    &lt;!-- 3. Structure at a glance --&gt;\n    &lt;div class="box"&gt;\n      &lt;div class="box-head"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;i class="fas fa-chart-bar"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;Структура баланса&lt;/span&gt;\n        &lt;span class="hint"&gt;каждая полоса = 100%&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;div class="box-body"&gt;\n        &lt;div class="stack-row"&gt;&lt;div class="lab"&gt;Активы&lt;/div&gt;\n          &lt;div class="stack"&gt;{% for r in assets_structure %}{% if r.net &gt; 0 %}&lt;span style="width:{{ r.w }}%;background:{{ r.colour }}" title="{{ r.name }}"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;{% endif %}{% endfor %}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n        &lt;div class="legend"&gt;{% for r in assets_structure %}&lt;span&gt;&lt;i style="background:{{ r.colour }}"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;{{ r.name }} {{ r.pct|floatformat:1 }}%&lt;/span&gt;{% endfor %}&lt;/div&gt;\n        &lt;div class="stack-row"&gt;&lt;div class="lab"&gt;Пассивы&lt;/div&gt;\n          &lt;div class="stack"&gt;{% for r in passive_bar %}{% if r.net &gt; 0 %}&lt;span style="width:{{ r.w }}%;background:{{ r.colour }}" title="{{ r.name }}"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;{% endif %}{% endfor %}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n        &lt;div class="legend"&gt;{% for r in passive_bar %}&lt;span&gt;&lt;i style="background:{{ r.colour }}"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;{{ r.name }} {{ r.pct|floatformat:1 }}%&lt;/span&gt;{% endfor %}&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n\n    &lt;!-- 4. Assets | Liabilities + Equity --&gt;\n    &lt;div class="row g-3"&gt;\n      &lt;div class="col-lg-6"&gt;\n        &lt;div class="box"&gt;&lt;div class="box-body"&gt;\n          &lt;div class="side-head"&gt;&lt;span class="t"&gt;Активы&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="v"&gt;{{ total_assets|format_currency }}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n          {% for r in assets_structure %}\n          &lt;div class="grp"&gt;\n            &lt;div class="grp-top"&gt;&lt;div class="grp-icon"&gt;&lt;i class="fas {{ r.icon }}"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n              &lt;div class="grp-name"&gt;{{ r.name }}&lt;/div&gt;\n              &lt;div class="grp-val"&gt;{{ r.net|format_currency }}&lt;small&gt;{{ r.pct|floatformat:1 }}%&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n            &lt;div class="bar"&gt;&lt;span style="width:{{ r.w }}%"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n            {% if r.has_reserve %}&lt;div class="net-line"&gt;брутто {{ r.gross|format_currency }} · резервы и контрсчета −{{ r.reserve|format_currency }}&lt;/div&gt;{% endif %}\n          &lt;/div&gt;\n          {% endfor %}\n        &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;div class="col-lg-6"&gt;\n        &lt;div class="box"&gt;&lt;div class="box-body"&gt;\n          &lt;div class="side-head"&gt;&lt;span class="t"&gt;Обязательства&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="v"&gt;{{ total_liabilities|format_currency }}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n          {% for r in liabilities_structure %}\n          &lt;div class="grp"&gt;\n            &lt;div class="grp-top"&gt;&lt;div class="grp-icon"&gt;&lt;i class="fas {{ r.icon }}"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n              &lt;div class="grp-name"&gt;{{ r.name }}&lt;/div&gt;\n              &lt;div class="grp-val"&gt;{{ r.net|format_currency }}&lt;small&gt;{{ r.pct|floatformat:1 }}% пассивов&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n            &lt;div class="bar dark"&gt;&lt;span style="width:{{ r.w }}%"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n          &lt;/div&gt;\n          {% endfor %}\n          &lt;div class="side-head mt-4"&gt;&lt;span class="t"&gt;Капитал&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="v"&gt;{{ total_equity|format_currency }}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n          {% for r in equity_structure %}\n          &lt;div class="grp"&gt;\n            &lt;div class="grp-top"&gt;&lt;div class="grp-icon"&gt;&lt;i class="fas {{ r.icon }}"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n              &lt;div class="grp-name"&gt;{{ r.name }}&lt;/div&gt;\n              &lt;div class="grp-val{% if r.net &lt; 0 %} bad{% endif %}"&gt;{{ r.net|format_currency }}&lt;small&gt;{{ r.pct|floatformat:1 }}% пассивов&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n            &lt;div class="bar dark"&gt;&lt;span style="width:{{ r.w }}%"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n            {% if r.has_reserve %}&lt;div class="net-line"&gt;выкупленные акции / неоплаченная подписка −{{ r.reserve|format_currency }}&lt;/div&gt;{% endif %}\n          &lt;/div&gt;\n          {% endfor %}\n        &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n\n    &lt;!-- 5. Ratios --&gt;\n    &lt;div class="box"&gt;\n      &lt;div class="box-head"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;i class="fas fa-gauge-high"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;Показатели&lt;/span&gt;\n        &lt;span class="hint"&gt;аналитика по балансу, не нормативы ЦБ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;div class="box-body"&gt;&lt;div class="kpis"&gt;\n        {% for r in ratios %}\n        &lt;div class="kpi"&gt;&lt;div class="l"&gt;&lt;i class="fas {{ r.icon }}"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;{{ r.name }}&lt;/div&gt;\n          &lt;div class="v"&gt;{{ r.value|floatformat:1 }}%&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="h"&gt;{{ r.how }}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n        {% endfor %}\n      &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n\n    &lt;!-- 6. Profit --&gt;\n    &lt;div class="box"&gt;\n      &lt;div class="box-head"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;i class="fas fa-chart-line"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;Как складывается прибыль&lt;/span&gt;\n        &lt;span class="hint"&gt;с 1 января по {{ date_display }}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;div class="box-body"&gt;\n        {% for s in waterfall %}\n        &lt;div class="wf-row{% if s.is_sub %} sub{% endif %}{% if s.neg %} neg{% endif %}"&gt;\n          &lt;div&gt;{{ s.label }}&lt;/div&gt;\n          &lt;div class="wf-track"&gt;&lt;span style="left:{{ s.left }}%;width:{{ s.w }}%"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n          &lt;div class="m{% if s.is_sub and s.neg %} bad{% endif %}"&gt;{{ s.value|format_currency }}&lt;/div&gt;\n        &lt;/div&gt;\n        {% endfor %}\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n\n    &lt;div class="row g-3"&gt;\n      &lt;div class="col-lg-6"&gt;\n        &lt;div class="box"&gt;&lt;div class="box-body"&gt;\n          &lt;div class="side-head"&gt;&lt;span class="t"&gt;Доходы&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="v"&gt;{{ total_income|format_currency }}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n          {% for r in income_structure %}\n          &lt;div class="grp"&gt;\n            &lt;div class="grp-top"&gt;&lt;div class="grp-icon"&gt;&lt;i class="fas {{ r.icon }}"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n              &lt;div class="grp-name"&gt;{{ r.name }}&lt;/div&gt;\n              &lt;div class="grp-val"&gt;{{ r.net|format_currency }}&lt;small&gt;{{ r.pct|floatformat:1 }}%&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n            &lt;div class="bar"&gt;&lt;span style="width:{{ r.w }}%"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n          &lt;/div&gt;\n          {% endfor %}\n        &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;div class="col-lg-6"&gt;\n        &lt;div class="box"&gt;&lt;div class="box-body"&gt;\n          &lt;div class="side-head"&gt;&lt;span class="t"&gt;Расходы&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="v"&gt;{{ total_expenses|format_currency }}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n          {% for r in expense_structure %}\n          &lt;div class="grp"&gt;\n            &lt;div class="grp-top"&gt;&lt;div class="grp-icon"&gt;&lt;i class="fas {{ r.icon }}"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n              &lt;div class="grp-name"&gt;{{ r.name }}&lt;/div&gt;\n              &lt;div class="grp-val"&gt;{{ r.net|format_currency }}&lt;small&gt;{{ r.pct|floatformat:1 }}%&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n            &lt;div class="bar dark"&gt;&lt;span style="width:{{ r.w }}%"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n          &lt;/div&gt;\n          {% endfor %}\n        &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n\n    &lt;!-- 7. Currency --&gt;\n    &lt;div class="box"&gt;\n      &lt;div class="box-head"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;i class="fas fa-coins"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;Валютная структура&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;div class="box-body"&gt;\n        &lt;div class="stack-row"&gt;&lt;div class="lab"&gt;Активы&lt;/div&gt;\n          &lt;div class="stack"&gt;{% for r in assets_by_currency %}{% if r.money &gt; 0 %}&lt;span style="width:{{ r.w }}%;background:{{ r.colour }}" title="{{ r.cur }}"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;{% endif %}{% endfor %}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n        &lt;div class="legend"&gt;{% for r in assets_by_currency %}&lt;span&gt;&lt;i style="background:{{ r.colour }}"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;{{ r.cur }} {{ r.pct|floatformat:1 }}%&lt;/span&gt;{% endfor %}&lt;/div&gt;\n        &lt;div class="stack-row"&gt;&lt;div class="lab"&gt;Обязат.&lt;/div&gt;\n          &lt;div class="stack"&gt;{% for r in liabs_by_currency %}{% if r.money &gt; 0 %}&lt;span style="width:{{ r.w }}%;background:{{ r.colour }}" title="{{ r.cur }}"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;{% endif %}{% endfor %}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n        &lt;div class="legend"&gt;{% for r in liabs_by_currency %}&lt;span&gt;&lt;i style="background:{{ r.colour }}"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;{{ r.cur }} {{ r.pct|floatformat:1 }}%&lt;/span&gt;{% endfor %}&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n\n    &lt;!-- 8. Largest accounts --&gt;\n    &lt;div class="row g-3"&gt;\n      &lt;div class="col-lg-6"&gt;&lt;div class="box"&gt;\n        &lt;div class="box-head"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;i class="fas fa-list-ol"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;Крупнейшие счета актива&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n        &lt;table&gt;&lt;thead&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;Счёт&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Группа&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th class="m"&gt;Сумма&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th class="m"&gt;%&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/thead&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;\n        {% for a in top_assets %}&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;{{ a.acc }}&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;{{ a.grp }}&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class="m"&gt;{{ a.money|format_currency }}&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class="m"&gt;{{ a.pct|floatformat:1 }}&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;{% endfor %}\n        &lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;div class="col-lg-6"&gt;&lt;div class="box"&gt;\n        &lt;div class="box-head"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;i class="fas fa-list-ol"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;Крупнейшие счета пассива&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n        &lt;table&gt;&lt;thead&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;Счёт&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Группа&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th class="m"&gt;Сумма&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th class="m"&gt;%&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/thead&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;\n        {% for a in top_liabilities %}&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;{{ a.acc }}&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;{{ a.grp }}&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class="m"&gt;{{ a.money|format_currency }}&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class="m"&gt;{{ a.pct|floatformat:1 }}&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;{% endfor %}\n        &lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n\n    &lt;!-- 9. How it is calculated --&gt;\n    &lt;div class="box"&gt;\n      &lt;div class="box-head"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;i class="fas fa-circle-info"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;Как считается&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;div class="box-body"&gt;&lt;ul class="rules"&gt;\n        &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Активы&lt;/strong&gt; — все счета на 1, кроме {{ rules.assets }}. Резервы, амортизация и дисконты (контрсчета) уже вычтены.&lt;/li&gt;\n        &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Обязательства&lt;/strong&gt; — все счета на 2, кроме {{ rules.liabilities }}.&lt;/li&gt;\n        &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;161 ↔ 222&lt;/strong&gt; — расчёты головного офиса с филиалами: внутри банка они взаимно гасятся, поэтому убраны с обеих сторон.&lt;/li&gt;\n        &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;175 ↔ 23416&lt;/strong&gt; — счета правительства и фонд специального назначения: транзитные бюджетные средства, тоже убраны парой.&lt;/li&gt;\n        &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Капитал&lt;/strong&gt; — все счета на 3. Прибыль текущего года (классы 4 и 5) добавлена в 31206 при загрузке.&lt;/li&gt;\n        &lt;li&gt;Группы и исключения задаются списками в начале &lt;code&gt;functions.py&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;\n      &lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;script&gt;\n  function downloadDashboard() {\n    html2canvas(document.getElementById("export-area"), {scale: 2, backgroundColor: "#ffffff"}).then(canvas =&gt; {\n      const link = document.createElement(\'a\');\n      link.download = \'Balans_{{ date_str }}.png\';\n      link.href = canvas.toDataURL("image/png");\n      link.click();\n    });\n  }\n&lt;/script&gt;\n{% else %}\n&lt;div class="container py-5 text-center"&gt;\n  &lt;i class="fas fa-lock fa-3x mb-3"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;\n  &lt;h3&gt;Доступ ограничен&lt;/h3&gt;\n  &lt;a href="{% url \'login\' %}" class="btn btn-warning mt-2"&gt;&lt;i class="fas fa-sign-in-alt me-1"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;Войти&lt;/a&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n{% endif %}\n{% endblock %}\n</code></pre>\n'})
